{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Odisha Minor Crop Yield Forecasting API","description":"Production RESTful API serving Machine Learning yield rate forecasts and agricultural estimates for minor crops across all 30 districts of Odisha. **All predictive outputs are labeled as Analytical Estimates.**","version":"1.0.0"},"paths":{"/":{"get":{"tags":["UI"],"summary":"Serve Ui","description":"Serves the lightweight interactive web dashboard.","operationId":"serve_ui__get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api":{"get":{"tags":["General"],"summary":"Api Index","description":"API discovery endpoint providing service status and endpoint links.","operationId":"api_index_api_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/health":{"get":{"tags":["General"],"summary":"Health","description":"Health check endpoint returning system status and model readiness.","operationId":"health_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/predict":{"post":{"tags":["Forecasting"],"summary":"Forecast Crop Yield","description":"Generate yield rate and total production forecasts for a specific crop, district, season, and area.\n**Predictive outputs are strictly labeled as Analytical Estimates.**\n\n- **district**: One of the 30 districts in Odisha (e.g. ANUGUL, BALANGIR, CUTTACK, etc.)\n- **season**: Autumn, Winter, or Summer\n- **minor_crop**: Crop variety (e.g. POTATO, MAIZE, GREENGRAM, SUGARCANE, etc.)\n- **area_ha**: Cultivated area in hectares (> 0)","operationId":"forecast_crop_yield_predict_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CropYieldPredictionRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ForecastResponse"}}}},"422":{"